From: VDR-Suite MLD integration
Subject: [PATCH] restfulapi: guard absent EPG artwork root in recording output

If the configured/default EPG image directory does not exist, Settings
leaves its path empty. A JSON recording with TVScraper media then calls
cleanImagePath(), which passes the empty prefix to StringExtension::replace.
Because replacing an empty substring with an empty string never advances the
search position, the RESTfulAPI HTTP request never completes.

Return no relative image path when no EPG root is configured and make the
shared replace utility safe for all empty-needle callers.

This patch is a SOURCE-LEVEL CANDIDATE for the RESTfulAPI SRCREV
79f9bd26370a08d6c5186c19cefa300c569045ea. It has not been applied to
the MLD BitBake recipe or validated on Pit's host.

---
 scraper2vdr.cpp | 4 ++++
 tools.cpp       | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/scraper2vdr.cpp b/scraper2vdr.cpp
--- a/scraper2vdr.cpp
+++ b/scraper2vdr.cpp
@@ -184,6 +184,10 @@
 string Scraper2VdrService::cleanImagePath(string path) {

+  // An absent EPG image directory must not trigger empty-string replacement.
+  if (epgImagesDir.empty())
+    return "";
+
   path = StringExtension::replace(path, epgImagesDir, "");
   path.erase(0, path.find_first_not_of("/"));
   return path;
 };
diff --git a/tools.cpp b/tools.cpp
--- a/tools.cpp
+++ b/tools.cpp
@@ -1375,6 +1375,9 @@
 string StringExtension::replace(string const& text, string const& substring, string const& replacement)
 {
+  if (substring.empty())
+    return text;
+
   std::string result = text;
   std::string::size_type pos = 0;
   while ( ( pos = result.find( substring, pos ) ) != std::string::npos ) {
     result.replace( pos, substring.length(), replacement );
